exports[`role=any skills given: [case5] grove.census, over a home with one unreadable transcript when: [t1] it renders the tree then: the tree matches its snapshot, its live values masked 1`] = `
"🐚 grove.census
   ├─ grove: <grove>
   ├─ cpu: N of N cores busy over Ns · load N / N · psi some avgN N%
   ├─ cpu in crews: N cores · outside crews: <the box>
   ├─ ram: NG avail of NG · swap NG · psi some N% full N%
   ├─ forks: N/s over Ns
   ├─ account burn over N min: NM weighted · NM raw (a lower bound: N transcripts unread — e.g. <home>/git/sandpine/_worktrees/svc-lessons.beav.fix-tide-chart/.agent/.actors/actor.via.repo=ambient/brain/.claude/projects/project-N/session-N.jsonl)
   ├─ accounts (signed in now — a swap inside the span misattributes)
   │  └─ bert@example.com: NM weighted · N config dirs
   ├─ boot toll over the N min span (first call of each transcript begun in it; resumes count, so an upper bound)
   │  ├─ boot.md: N of N config dirs · median NKB · max NKB
   │  ├─ seats: N boots · first prompt median NK · written fresh median NK · toll NK (NK/h)
   │  └─ forks: N boots · first prompt median NK · written fresh median NK · toll NK (NK/h)
   ├─ hooks over the N min span: N runs (N PreToolUse) · Ns wall · ≤ N cores (wall time, so an upper bound on their cpu)
   └─ crews (ram now · tokens over the N min span, cost-weighted)
      └─ svc-lessons.beav.feat-book-a-lesson: NG · N cores · N seats · N procs · NM weighted (NM/h) · raw NM · out NM · forks NM
"
`;

